<ManSection Label="EmbeddingOfDoubleGon">   
  <Oper Arg=" [n,draw]" Name="EmbeddingOfDoubleGon" Label=" "/>
  <Returns>
    a list          
  </Returns>   
  <Description>

  Returns a List where the first entry is the DoubleGon
  and the second entry are the coordinates of a parameterized
  embedding with isoceles triangles.
  The embedding has <K>n</K> vertices forming a regular <K>n</K>-gon and the other two 
  vertices are positioned at the center with height given by the parameter <K>z</K>.
   <Br/>
  
  The parameter <K>draw</K> indicates whether <A>.html</A> file named
  "octahedron_parameterized" is generated or not.
  The parameter <K>draw</K> is by default <K>false</K>. 
<Log><![CDATA[
gap> EmbeddingOfDoubleGon(6,true);
[ simplicial surface (8 vertices, 18 edges, and 12 faces)
    , 
  [ [ 1., 0., 0 ], [ 0.5, 0.866025, 0 ], [ -0.5, 0.866025, 0 ], 
      [ -1., 1.22465e-16, 0 ], [ -0.5, -0.866025, 0 ], [ 0.5, -0.866025, 0 ], 
      [ 0, 0, "z" ], [ 0, 0, "-z" ] ] ]
]]></Log>

</ManSection>

